            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can reproduce and it is indeed introduced in ca7335433ceb16d7eef523338276f23d6aad17f5. The reason is that these `gopls` completion candidates include both `additionalTextEdits` and `textEdit` for a snippet item. The 'mini.completion' applies `additionalTextEdits` first which makes \"absolute\" range in `textEdit` outdated. Like if `textEdit` says that completion item spans columns 6-7, but `additionalTextEdits` removes columns 1-5.\n\nApplying additional text edits after adjusting the buffer text for and with `textEdit` but before insert snippet seems to fix the issue. But I'd like to investigate a bit if this has issues with other LSP servers.",
