            "body": "> It not always happen but sometimes(I also reported the issue in reddit). like below,\n\nCouple of questions:\n- Are you sure you don't have another autocompletion plugin/functionality enabled? *Just* after typing `func`, the completion menu adds three more entries (plus one *just* before the snippet session is started). However, info window is not adjusted, which makes me think that this doesn't come from 'mini.completion'.\n- What other LSP server do you have attached here? My guess would be the one from 'mini.snippets' (the `func` snippet is the same as in 'friendly-snippets').\n- Can you please clarify which 'completeopt' you have set and which keys you press to accept completion item?",
